{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-64915-r4515343","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Tropical Squares","sourcePageId":64915,"sourceRevision":"4515343","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-06-19T03:08:50Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Tropical%20Squares&oldid=4515343","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T16:18:27.026Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Baking recipes","Category:Medium Difficulty recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for cookies","Category:Recipes using all-purpose flour","Category:Recipes using baking powder","Category:Recipes using coconut","Category:Recipes using egg","Category:Recipes using granulated sugar","Category:Recipes using lemon juice","Category:Recipes using margarine","Category:Recipes using pineapple","Category:Recipes with metric units","Category:Recipes without servings"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"43d50c25df9ff8c8dcc76452de38c7bd71fae1ad82257fbd17cd4261d051f078","sourceWikitext":"__NOTOC__\n{{recipesummary|category=Confection recipes|time=50–55 minutes|difficulty=3\n}}\n\n{{recipe}} | [[Cookbook:Confections|Confections]]\n\nA delicious square recipe with a tropical flavor.\n\n==Ingredients==\n===Base===\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] (240 [[Cookbook:Gram|g]]) [[Cookbook:Flour|all-purpose flour]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tablespoon]] [[Cookbook:white sugar|white granulated sugar]]\n* ¼ [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] (60 g) [[Cookbook:margarine|margarine]], cold\n* ¼ [[Cookbook:teaspoon|teaspoon]] [[Cookbook:Baking Powder|baking powder]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:egg|egg]], beaten\n\n===Top Layer===\n* 2 [[Cookbook:egg|egg]]s, beaten\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Cup|cups]] (480 g) [[Cookbook:coconut|coconut]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] (240 g) [[Cookbook:white sugar|white granulated sugar]]\n* 1 tin crushed [[Cookbook:pineapple|pineapple]], drained\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tablespoon]] [[Cookbook:margarine|margarine]], melted\n* 1 [[Cookbook:teaspoon|teaspoon]] [[Cookbook:Lemon Juice|lemon juice]]\n\n==Procedure==\n===Base===\n#Stir together flour, sugar and baking powder using a wooden spoon.\n#Cut in the margarine until the mixture looks like fine crumbs.\n#In a small bowl, [[Cookbook:Beating|beat]] the egg well. Mix into dry mixture using wooden spoon until combined.\n#Press into lined and lightly greased square tray.\n\n===Top layer=== \n#Drain all of the juice out of the pineapple by wringing it in a cloth.\n#Add and mix remaining ingredients with the pineapple using a wooden spoon. Do not overwork it.\n#Spread evenly over base.\n#[[Cookbook:Baking|Bake]] at [[Cookbook:Oven Temperatures|350°F]] (180°C), or until topping is set and coconut is light brown.\n#Let cool before removing from pan.\n\n[[Category:Recipes for cookies]]\n[[Category:Recipes using pineapple]]\n[[Category:Recipes using coconut]]\n[[Category:Baking recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes_with_metric_units]]\n[[Category:Recipes using egg]]\n[[Category:Recipes using baking powder]]\n[[Category:Recipes using granulated sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using all-purpose flour]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lemon juice]]\n[[Category:Recipes using margarine]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Tropical Squares","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"sou